---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/layout/Breadcrumb.astro';
import { founders } from '../../lib/site-config';

const breadcrumbItems = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/en/' },
  { name: 'About Us', url: '/en/about' },
];

const visibleFounders = founders.filter((f) => f.published);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Why we run PH Clark Times, our founder's background, and our connection to the Philippines and Clark."
>
  <Breadcrumb items={breadcrumbItems} locale="en" />

  <section class="bg-navy-950">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[720px] px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-accent-500">About us</p>
      <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">About Us</h1>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-navy-200">
        We run this site for Japanese companies considering expansion into Clark, Philippines —
        bringing together the information you need in a clear, accessible form to help support
        that move.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[720px] px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
    <section class="mb-16" aria-labelledby="clark-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-accent-700">About Clark</p>
      <h2 id="clark-heading" class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-navy-950">
        About Clark
      </h2>
      <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-navy-700">
        Why do we focus on Clark specifically, rather than the Philippines as a whole? Here are a
        few key points about the area itself.
      </p>

      <div class="mb-6 rounded-xl border border-navy-100 p-6 sm:p-8">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 240 400" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-[220px]" role="img" aria-labelledby="clark-map-title-en">
          <title id="clark-map-title-en">Simplified map showing Clark's location relative to Manila on Luzon island</title>
          <path
            d="M120,20 C90,10 60,40 55,90 C50,140 70,170 60,210 C50,250 30,270 40,310 C50,350 90,370 110,395 C130,375 160,360 170,330 C180,300 165,280 175,250 C185,220 200,200 190,160 C180,120 190,80 170,50 C155,25 140,15 120,20 Z"
            class="fill-navy-50 stroke-navy-200"
            stroke-width="2"
          />
          <line x1="80" y1="192" x2="97" y2="228" stroke-dasharray="4 4" class="stroke-navy-400" stroke-width="1.5" />
          <circle cx="80" cy="192" r="7" class="fill-accent-500 stroke-navy-950" stroke-width="1.5" />
          <circle cx="97" cy="228" r="6" class="fill-navy-700" />
          <text x="92" y="188" class="fill-navy-950" font-size="15" font-weight="700">Clark</text>
          <text x="107" y="235" class="fill-navy-700" font-size="12">Manila</text>
          <text x="50" y="270" class="fill-navy-600" font-size="10">~1.5 hrs by car</text>
        </svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-navy-500">
          A simplified diagram showing Clark's location relative to Manila (not an exact map)
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul class="space-y-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-navy-700">
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Increasingly described as "the next BGC" — an area drawing growing attention
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Home to Clark International Airport, giving it solid international connectivity
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          About a 1.5-hour drive from central Manila
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          A rail line connecting the area is planned for the future
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Government offices are also planned to relocate here, expected to strengthen administrative functions
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          An area expected to see further economic development
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Increasingly drawing attention from around the world
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          A former U.S. military base, giving it exceptionally clean streets and well-maintained roads
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Already home to a number of Japanese companies
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Close to Subic Port, an advantage for logistics
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Potential to become a major hub for AI and data centers
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Home to numerous golf courses
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Pampanga, the province where Clark is located, is also famous for its food, including dishes like sisig
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-16" aria-labelledby="founders-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-accent-700">Founders</p>
      <h2 id="founders-heading" class="mb-8 text-2xl font-bold text-navy-950">
        Founder
      </h2>

      <div class={`grid gap-6 ${visibleFounders.length > 1 ? 'sm:grid-cols-2' : 'max-w-sm'}`}>
        {visibleFounders.map((founder) => (
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-navy-100 p-7 shadow-sm">
            <div
              class="mb-5 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy-950 text-xl font-bold text-accent-500"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              {founder.name.charAt(0)}
            </div>
            <h3 class="mb-1 text-lg font-bold text-navy-950">{founder.name}</h3>
            <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-700">{founder.role.en}</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-navy-700">{founder.bio.en}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-16" aria-labelledby="connection-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-accent-700">Local Network</p>
      <h2 id="connection-heading" class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-navy-950">
        Our connection on the ground
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-navy-700">
        {/* TODO: Placeholder. Describe local contacts, partners, and networks in Clark/Pampanga. */}
        Here, we'll explain our network on the ground in Clark and the Philippines, and our
        relationships with local partners. This is an important section that supports how we
        gather and verify information.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-xl bg-navy-50 p-8" aria-labelledby="mission-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-accent-700">Our Principles</p>
      <h2 id="mission-heading" class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-navy-950">
        How we work
      </h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-navy-700">
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Every figure includes its source, when it was collected, and when it was last verified.
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Estimates always come with the basis for the calculation.
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          We don't publish articles that are just generic commentary with no substance.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
